-> HTTPService should be a standalone object with url to initiate it : keep it as is (add the fixing timestamp at which the service is run)

-> MongoMarketDataService should be an object which: 
- can stream the data 
- write it in mongo 
- get it from mongo 
- stream&write function that can be run continuously 

-> For example : Yahoo Finance SOFR Quotes once you stream it you can: 
- if streamed, Access directly the data 
- if streamed, write the data in mongo 
- if written in mongo, access the data directly from mongo 
- Access old written data on mongo 

->> DATA IS RAW (_id ; _timestamp ; _raw_data)

